From: u5b0c9158bfa781ba at groups.google.com (Saptarshi Guha)
Date: Thu, 26 Mar 2015 16:03:11 +0000
Subject: Re: [rhipe] Setting mapper count / split count via mapreduce.job.maps
Message-ID: <jd4-fNbjigA.uLmlBo91kO0J@rhipe.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <jd4-fNbjigA.UfupN0gVYaUJ@rhipe.groups.google.com>
